{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52587","headline":"七夕感逝 · 宋务光","name":"七夕感逝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生代日何短，徂迁岁欲期。\n始闻春鸟思，溘见凉云滋。\n皎皎河汉匹，三秋会有期。\n嗟嗟瑟琹偶，一去无还时。\n晴壁看遗挂，虚檐想步綦。\n流芳行处歇，空色梦中疑。\n昔有秦嘉赠，今爲潘岳诗。\n百忧人自老，玄发新成丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋务光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}